  dates:\n  Paper submission: 15 Apr 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Notif
 ication of decision: 15 Jun 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Final paper s
 ubmission: 15 Sept 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nThe call for papers st
 ates no timezone. This is counted as UTC+12\, the earliest it could plausi
 bly mean\, so the countdown runs out before the real deadline rather than 
